  "description": "Leonard receives a small favor from a woman he has just met. He decides to return the kindness, but he has no idea what that \"repayment\" will actually entail. As it turns out, what she wants in return is this: “This is the man I’ve promised to marry!” He is about to find himself bound to her for the rest of his life. Irenea Blair. After losing her parents, she was exploited by her uncle—only to eventually lose her own life as well. Or so it seemed—yet, she has returned to a time before everything was taken from her. This time, she will not let anything be stolen away. And there is something else, too—something she must reclaim at all costs. Her heartless knight—the one who broke his promise never to die and leave her behind. \"This time, I will be the one to protect you. So that you never lose a single thing.\"\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
